  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">North East Nigeria Transition to Development Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver an effective response to the basic needs of vulnerable people impacted by the crisis in the North East of Nigeria. The programme will deliver humanitarian assistance in nutrition and food security; protection and Education in Emergencies; multi-sector support including health, water, shelter and livelihoods interventions; as well as enabling a more efficient response to the crisis, including strengthened government planning, budgeting and coordination; and risk management.</narrative>
  </description>
